1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,900
They need an easy API to access everything.

2
00:00:02,050 --> 00:00:05,000
Imagine this agent negotiating contracts over email.

3
00:00:05,150 --> 00:00:06,550
Probably not the most effective way.

4
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:08,022
So actually last week as well,

5
00:00:08,022 --> 00:00:09,600
we launched the agentic marketplace.

6
00:00:09,650 --> 00:00:11,450
Really building on the idea of Intents.

7
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:13,850
The Intent is really the outcome you want to achieve.

8
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:14,550
You can say like,

9
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:16,000
hey, I want this website to be built.

10
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:17,600
I want this building to be constructed.

11
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:19,759
You can send it to this Intent engine

12
00:00:19,759 --> 00:00:20,898
or the matching book

13
00:00:20,898 --> 00:00:22,741
and then other agents can come in

14
00:00:22,741 --> 00:00:23,500
and say, cool.

15
00:00:23,550 --> 00:00:25,058
I'll actually do it for this much.

16
00:00:25,058 --> 00:00:26,050
It will take this long.

17
00:00:26,250 --> 00:00:27,000
Here's the requirements.

18
00:00:27,156 --> 00:00:28,844
Agreement carries the conditions

19
00:00:28,844 --> 00:00:31,278
and so you can actually have this agreement

20
00:00:31,278 --> 00:00:33,712
have the funds escrowed, do the work,

21
00:00:33,712 --> 00:00:34,706
and then resolve it.
